# Patch branches applied on top of `staging`, in order, to build `luma/staging`.
# One branch per line, then `#` and one sentence for the release notes of the fork build.
# patch/fork-tooling is applied after these by rebuild.sh; do not list it.
patch/slurp-locked-scene # Half of locked posts keep their scene, and the spicy kind no longer repeats back to back.
patch/slurp-opener-all-posts # The overused-opener check reads every recent post, locked ones included.
patch/slurp-unique-sequence # Two posts written close together no longer get the same details.
patch/slurp-card-interests # A card's likes and hobbies reach every post, and section headings are no longer read as facts.
patch/slurp-quiet-days # Quiet days are one line in the recent-activity list, so real activity fills it.
patch/slurp-card-core # The card's core in every brief is about four times longer.
patch/slurp-character-ideas # Creators choose each automatic post's idea from their whole card, and a new setting sets the locked share.
patch/slurp-reference-scope # Pictures send references only for the people in them.
patch/otome-art-reference # Looks and portraits keep the installed base sprite as their likeness, looks follow a framing setting, each kind of picture can have its own connection, and expression edits follow how each love interest shows a feeling.
patch/otome-reader-head-layer # The story reader's header no longer flickers each time the text advances on a phone.
patch/otome-quiz-pairing # The personality quiz asks about who leads and who yields in pairs, and a love interest who takes charge now matches a player who likes to give it up.
